# Unzipped Gerbers: fab.gerbers() exports each board's Gerbers and drill
# files into <board>/production/gerbers/ and zips them.  The zip beside the
# folder is what is committed and ordered from; the folder is the build's
# working copy.
*/production/gerbers/

# The CadQuery environment for heatsink.py (requirements-cadquery.txt)
.venv-cq/

# KiCad's autosave and old-style backups, when a board is opened in KiCad
_autosave-*
*.bak

# The product videos (video/make_video.py), wherever one is saved: rendered,
# too large for git, and their music is licensed (video/.gitignore keeps the
# music out; video/out/ is ignored as out/ by the root .gitignore)
*.mp4
